  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small communities sanitation; Local consultant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The local consultant will provide key data for relevant scenario development, being feasible scenarios to improve the sanitation coverage of small communities in Egypt, as well as testing its implementation potential in different geographic contexts in Egypt.The proposed scenarios will be evaluated and validated, in terms of financial viability and sustainability, in order to explore the potential for their translation to other rural small communities in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
